---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About Us
description: "Learn about Faith Baptist Church of Raymore, Missouri: our pastor and staff, what we believe, and our history since 1996."
---

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="page-head__eyebrow">About us</p>
    <h1>An independent, Bible-believing Baptist church</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Faith Baptist Church has served Raymore since 1996. We believe the Scriptures are the final authority for faith and life.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="cards">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cards__grid">
      {%- set pages = [
        { url: "/about-us/meet-our-staff/", img: "/assets/images/MeetOurStaff.jpg", title: "Meet Our Staff",
          text: "Get to know Pastor Michael Wessberg and our music director, Jim Stephens." },
        { url: "/about-us/what-we-believe/", img: "/assets/images/WhatWeBelieve.jpg", title: "What We Believe",
          text: "Our statement of faith on the Bible, God, salvation, eternal security, and the local church." },
        { url: "/about-us/our-history/", img: "/assets/images/OurHistory.jpg", title: "Our History",
          text: "From a handful of families in 1996 to the congregation that meets on Franklin Street today." },
        { url: "/visit/", img: "/assets/images/ContactUs.jpg", title: "Plan a Visit",
          text: "Service times, directions, our phone number, and what to expect when you come." }
      ] -%}

      {%- for item in pages %}
      <article class="card card--link">
        <img class="card__img" src="{{ item.img }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <div class="card__body">
          <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ item.text }}</p>
          <a class="card__link" href="{{ item.url }}">Read more</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="welcome">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="section-head__eyebrow">Our mission</p>
      <h2>Five things we aim to do</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="mission-list">
      <li><strong>Impact</strong> our community and proclaim Jesus Christ to those who may not know Him</li>
      <li><strong>Instruct</strong> them as they grow in the Lord</li>
      <li><strong>Include</strong> them in the fellowship of our church</li>
      <li><strong>Involve</strong> them in opportunities to serve, using their unique gifts and abilities</li>
      <li><strong>Inspire</strong> them to be all they can be for the Lord</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
